    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatshiatshia, butuku kabui buanze kutshia, yeye wakabika, wakaluhuka, wakaya mu tshihela, wakatendelelaku Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simona ne bakuabo bakadi nʼandi bakamulonda ku nyima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakamusangana, bakamuambila ne, Bantu bonso badi bakukeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabambila ne, Tuyai bietu kukuabo mu minga misoko idi ha buihi, mbambileku bualu bua Nzambi; nakuluila bualu ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakaya mu nsunagoga yabo ya mu luseke luonso lua Galela, ubambila bualu bua Nzambi, umusha bademon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muena nsudi wakalua kudiye, wakamutendekena, wakamutuila binu, wakamuambila ne, Biwasua kuenza nunku, udi mumanye mua kundengesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luse luakamukuata, wakolola tshianza, wakamulenga, wakamuambila ne, Ndi musue, wikale mulengeshibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsudi yakamulekela lukasa, wakalengeshibua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wakamukandika, wakamuhatula lukasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamuambila ne, Kuambidi muntu bualu ebu; uye biebe, udileshe kudi muakuidi, ufile biakamba Mose bu tshimanyishilu ku mesu kua bantu bualu bua kulengeshibua kuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi yeye wakaluhuka, wakabanga kumanyisha bantu, wakatangalasha bualu ebu; nunku Yesu kakamanya mua kubuela mu musoko bamumone kudi bantu, yeye wakadi anu mu bihela; bantu ba nseke yonso bakalua kudiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
